  <programDescriptions>
      <programName xml:lang="en">ArchiMate® Training — Practitioner (part 1 + part 2, 2-day) — accredited, including two exam vouchers</programName>
      <programSummaryText xml:lang="en">Accredited ArchiMate training (parts 1 + 2) in two consecutive days, including two exam vouchers you schedule yourself.</programSummaryText>
      <programDescriptionText xml:lang="en">The same content and the same accredited setup as the 3-day variant: the layers, core concepts and viewpoints of ArchiMate®, used to capture and communicate an enterprise architecture. The training covers part 1 (Foundation) and part 2 (Practitioner) and runs for two consecutive days. Instead of an exam day on site you receive two exam vouchers, so you schedule the official exams yourself. Prefer to sit the exams on location? That can be booked as an arrangement, as can the exam retake insurance.</programDescriptionText>
  </programDescriptions>

